"lines": [
"Jimmy Hoffa was last seen in a restaurant parking lot in 1975. Then he was gone.",
"The former Teamsters boss had gone there to meet two reputed mobsters.",
"From a pay phone, he called his wife. He said he'd been stood up.",
"His car was found in the lot.",
"Weeks later, police dogs picked up his scent in a different car.",
"Seven years later he was declared legally dead. There was still no body.",
"In 2001, DNA showed a hair found in that car was his.",
"In 2013, the FBI dug up a field near Detroit. Nothing.",
"Then a tip sent agents under a New Jersey bridge. Nothing of evidentiary value.",
"Fifty years on, the FBI says the case is still active.",
"Nobody explained it."
